// e2e keeps its own workspace, deliberately separate from the root go.work.
//
// e2e pins its own google.golang.org/adk v1.x (see the pin comment in go.mod)
// while the server uses google.golang.org/adk/v2. Sharing the root build list
// would let a server dependency bump move e2e's graph and break its test
// framework (runlog) — the exact breakage issue #770 fixed — so e2e keeps its
// own module graph. CI runs these modules with GOWORK=off; this file is what
// keeps a bare `go build ./...` / `go test ./...` inside e2e working locally.
//
// The e2e module SHALL stay isolated from the workspace build list. Modules
// listed here are exempt from the root
// coverage guard (.github/scripts/check-go-work-coverage.sh) because they are
// covered by this workspace instead.
go 1.26.0

use (
	.
	./stubs/github
	./stubs/gmail
	./stubs/mailgun
	./stubs/mcp-registry
	./stubs/web
)
